# Per-agent runtime state under <repo>/.claude and <repo>/.codex is all
# local and untracked, mirroring each other. settings.json /
# .codex/hooks.json are rendered outputs (configs/<agent>/ -> `just
# hooks-render`), rewritten kind-scoped at spawn; settings.local.json is
# operator-private (machine paths, personal allowlist). Edit the tracked
# sources under configs/, never these.
/.claude/*

